*.faiss
*.pkl
*.rar
*_id_map.pkl

# Scratch spreadsheets & load-test result dumps (keep curated reports under docs/)
API-Fast/*.xlsx
API-Fast/*.xls
API-Fast/*.csv
API-Fast/_inspect_*
ผลโหลดเทส/
loadtest-results/
scripts/kiosk-load/results/

